{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はアンダーライブの\nリハーサルに追われる日々です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントなどでも\nはずれたって方や、\n少ししか当たらなかった\nという方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんいらっしゃるので、\n期待されているんだと\n嬉しく思う反面、\nがっかりされないように\n頑張らなくてはと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと1週間もないのに、\n覚えることは山のようにあって。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもライブは大好きなので\n駆け抜けます(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に来てくれる方は\n一緒に最高の思い出を\n作りましょう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて\n前置きが長くなりましたが、、、\n本題へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の土曜日は\n個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会で\nさらに、今回から警備や\nレーンの仕組みが\nガラリと変わったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは楽しんで\nいただけたでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳重な警備や\n手荷物の管理\n握手の際の距離感など"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違うところが\nたくさんあって\n迷惑や負担をかけてしまったかも\nしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも握手会はやることに意味があるし、\n少し距離が離れてしまっても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと直接会話できる\n機会を継続することが出来て\n良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会は\n話題が絶えなくて\nずっと笑っていました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに4部はハーフアップで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部はポニーでした(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身はメールで送った\nとおりだよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれた方々、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は、７月の握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目からは部数も増えて、\n少し不安な私もいますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも変わらずに、\n楽しみたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは久しぶりに、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事Time"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはんはごはん派ですか？\nパン派ですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯派です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはんじゃなくても\n基本的にお米派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さいころからお米が大好きで、\n夕飯にパンとかパスタが出ると\n少し凹んでました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の中でパンはご飯じゃなくて\nお菓子なんです！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これかりんと共感し合ってるんだけど、わかる人いるかな？？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\n余談ですが今回個人PVで、\n田植え体験をさせて\nいただきましたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらチェックして\nみて下さい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米繋がりなので一応告知！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんの\n好きな飲み物ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的にはお茶かお水が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘い飲み物って\nその後、口が甘いままなのが嫌で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、水かお茶を買ってしまう\nからあんまり飲まないかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもしいて言うなら、\n飲むヨーグルトと\n林檎ジュースと\nサイダーが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？いっぱいある←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はここまでです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントでの\n質問ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつでも返して行くので、\nこれからも質問待ってます(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/25/2202875/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"}],"source":"archive"}